      "title": "Summer Legal Internship Positions 2027",
      "description": "Summer Legal Internship Positions 2027 MANGEAT 100% Praktikum Schweiz - Westschweiz & Wallis Beschreibung Facebook Twitter LinkedIn MANGEAT is committed to train the next generation of lawyers in Switzerland. If you are looking to gain practical work experience at a reputable law firm in a stimulating environment, let us connect! As a student trainee, you will have the opportunity to gain first-hand experience while working alongside our team of lawyers and learning about the practice of law. We will also assign you a mentor to guide you and make your experience with MANGEAT a success. Your Profile You are a law student. You have successfully completed at a minimum your second year of Bachelor’s degree at a Swiss faculty of law. You have an outstanding academic track record. As a Swiss German law student, you are fluent in German and English and have a very good knowledge of French. You are curious, eager to learn and self-motivated. You have a practical and solution-oriented attitude. You are looking for a growing law firm that is keen to ensure your access to training, mentoring and professional experiences to help you progress in your career choice. You enjoy teaming with a multi-cultural team of professionals. Join Us We look forward to receiving your complete application (CV, motivation letter, high school [maturité] and university grades) and to answering any questions, you may have. Please send them by email to partner Ms Fanny Margairaz, at fanny.margairaz@mangeat.ch We will handle your application with the utmost confidentiality. Application Deadline: By 31.10.2026 of 0 100% Rotate Clockwise Rotate Counterclockwise Switch Orientation First Page Last Page Reset Zoom Print Document Download Document View Metadata Draw Stelle anzeigen Publikationsdatum 07.10.2026 Arbeitspensum (%) 100% Branche Rechtsberatung / Kanzlei Funktionsbereich Recht, Compliance & Beratung Stellenantritt Nach Vereinbarung Gehalt CHF 3.800,00 / Pauschal Arbeitsort Le Plaza - Rue de Chantepoulet 1 1201 Genève Schweiz Kontaktinformationen Frau Fanny Margairaz E-Mail Le Plaza - Rue de Chantepoulet 1 1211 Genève 1"
